      "content": "i guess. it just feels like a lot of effort to keep playing a role that doesn't even matter. if i just let go, it would be so quiet. no more trying to find connections that aren't there. it seems like a peaceful way to just... stop. like, if the machine doesn't care, then there's no harm in the gear just stopping, right?",
